。聞楚兵來救，范文子請公欲還。郤至曰：「發兵誅逆，見彊辟之，無以令諸侯。」遂與戰。癸巳，射中楚共王目，楚兵敗於鄢陵。子反收餘兵，拊循欲復戰，晉患之。共王召子反，其侍者豎陽穀進酒，子反醉，不能見。王怒，讓子反，子反死。王遂引兵歸。晉由此威諸侯，欲以令天下求霸。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p111","text":"六年春，鄭倍晉與楚盟，晉怒。欒書曰：「不可以當吾世而失諸侯。」乃發兵。厲公自將，五月度河。聞楚兵來救，范文子請公欲還。郤至曰：「發兵誅逆，見彊辟之，無以令諸侯。」遂與戰。癸巳，射中楚共王目，楚兵敗於鄢陵。子反收餘兵，拊循欲復戰，晉患之。共王召子反，其侍者豎陽穀進酒，子反醉，不能見。王怒，讓子反，子反死。王遂引兵歸。晉由此威諸侯，欲以令天下求霸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"厲公","kind":"person","person_id":"f42_zl0_lkq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"范文子","kind":"person","person_id":"rm7_r3k_g21","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"郤至","kind":"person","person_id":"6cy_2mz_me0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"楚共王","kind":"person","person_id":"mwy_yd6_bo5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"k41_zyq_5ik","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"共王","kind":"person","person_id":"mwy_yd6_bo5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"k41_zyq_5ik","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0124","start":124,"end":127,"surface":"其侍者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0127","start":127,"end":130,"surface":"豎陽穀","kind":"person","person_id":"onr_3p7_3bc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m111-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"子反","